    "definition": "Current rights-cleared typed QazPost assignments and independently licensed point or area geometry pass complete declared coverage, current-versus-legacy validity, CRS/topology, RKA/building-link review, privacy, jurisdiction, freshness and digest gates, with reproducible transformation, immutable publication and actual AGID loader/API verification."
