  "rights_review": {
    "operator": "The current assignment rules describe free database access. The public service-26 documentation explicitly requires a bearer token. These establish access mechanisms, not an acquired complete current assignment dataset or exact bulk redistribution terms.",
    "geometry": "NSDI self-service provisions concern generally accessible spatial data, not blanket postal/address/building rights. No dataset-specific licensed geometry or explicit postal-object crosswalk was obtained.",
    "address_register": "The public certificate page describes login and digital-signature requests; no request, identity submission, RKA query or property-rights lookup was performed. Section 62 defines RKA length as 16 characters, without establishing an alphabet for this implementation.",
